                        "entry_id": "0e5c954e-edc2-3942-a7df-571f00a49fcf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A room near the entrance of a building; a front room."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95a83a92-7d16-49e8-9872-4c1d5201669f",
                                "sense_id": "ca388c94-0ba8-382e-92ad-7599034077a9",
                                "text": "Further up there are two summer rooms, a foreroom, and a kitchen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6ec3898-36bd-4bcc-970d-750d994c66d9",
                                "sense_id": "ca388c94-0ba8-382e-92ad-7599034077a9",
                                "text": "Hard and bloody was the defense of the foreroom men (the foreroom was the space just aft of the foredeck) and the stem-defenders, for in both those places the gunwale was the highest and the men picked."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6fc5c77-95dd-4871-98e3-d6a0e1ed7e00",
                                "sense_id": "ca388c94-0ba8-382e-92ad-7599034077a9",
                                "text": "It is my belief that he would like it better to die than to venture into the dark of the foreroom."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e106076-aa68-4da2-a7d6-d82cb56a0a6e",
                                "sense_id": "ca388c94-0ba8-382e-92ad-7599034077a9",
                                "text": "She did not want to join the Rangers in the foreroom. She wanted to be alone."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
